One-screen checklist
Named a contradiction? (not a compromise)
Have an ideal? (function without mechanism)
Exhausted existing resources before new UI?
Produced 2–3 different directions?
Checked the result against the contradiction? (dissolved or smoothed?)
Passed the 6-point validation gate before handing off?
Handed off in order: ux-copy → humanizer → ship?
Skill saved. Manage

